4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0Fo9wWBr4vkQ7kNvwGcLQFU&_nc_oc=AdpxUFjPllmcwOMtcVM09uSd1bM9nDWJKvjpYwQaqGjNL_JyaIl42eK5_BUuwkwtH-k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0DY2JjnjmPO3yzjykzSZKpgF9oazbOsudiJXmY8GRQNw&oe=69ECBBD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ADAn5yM7bQwQ7kNvwEFna3Y&_nc_oc=Adp9yyFFM70VWB1_1Zq2dCZpOhTd-T6E6TaHk_HURudvWsvFT8apmYcv2Hnug89uhkw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0_-h-8buYu4LBrxQmzKW2LnMWfwJrPQSCGAv4yT7UDzw&oe=69ECC0B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8Z27COrXGggQ7kNvwEy45As&_nc_oc=AdokqfqDbRZAurtBOStdY47In_s_Hetu2onJfWqC86m1GvCayAfLQzIyQUHRqYarR4U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0fOAoFOgxXuRR0VWTn8Hh5nq3rdQjJLnfnOJt5WEvw-A&oe=69ECCE55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p